IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GETQRISMERCHANT.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT MERCHANTS ASSIGN TO "/app/data/merchants.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD MERCHANTS.
01 MERCHANT-RECORD PIC X(400).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EOF-MERCHANTS PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-MERCHANT-ID PIC X(20).
01 WS-MERCHANT-NAME PIC X(100).
01 WS-PHYS-ADDRESS PIC X(200).
01 WS-FOUND PIC X VALUE "N".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 L-MERCHANT-ID PIC X(20).
01 L-RESULT PIC X(300).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-MERCHANT-ID L-RESULT.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF-MERCHANTS
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FOUND
    MOVE SPACES TO L-RESULT

    OPEN INPUT MERCHANTS

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF-MERCHANTS = "Y"
        READ MERCHANTS
            AT END
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF-MERCHANTS
            NOT AT END
                UNSTRING MERCHANT-RECORD DELIMITED BY "|"
                    INTO WS-MERCHANT-ID WS-MERCHANT-NAME WS-PHYS-ADDRESS

                IF FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MERCHANT-ID) = FUNCTION TRIM(L-MERCHANT-ID)
                    MOVE "Y" TO WS-FOUND
                    STRING "OK|"
                        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MERCHANT-ID) "|"
                        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MERCHANT-NAME) "|"
                        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PHYS-ADDRESS)
                        INTO L-RESULT
                    END-STRING
                    MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF-MERCHANTS
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM

    CLOSE MERCHANTS

    IF WS-FOUND NOT = "Y"
        MOVE "ERR|NO_MERCHANT" TO L-RESULT
    END-IF

    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM GETQRISMERCHANT.